WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.744
Why did nobody show up on launch day? Let's rewind.

2
00:00:04.894 --> 00:00:13.846
Four weeks ago, you shipped a waitlist in an afternoon. A form widget, a spreadsheet, a Zapier hook, and a generic thanks screen.

3
00:00:14.846 --> 00:00:28.598
Bots found your form before customers did. One person gamed your referral spots with burner emails. Four hundred twelve signups. One hundred eighty-seven fake. Zero referrals. And no idea which post actually worked.

4
00:00:30.198 --> 00:00:32.070
Meet Waitlyze.

5
00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:44.786
When someone joins your waitlist, Waitlyze verifies their email, locks in their live queue spot, and hands them a personal referral link — so every real signup brings the next three.

6
00:00:45.986 --> 00:00:55.778
Bots stop at Cloudflare Turnstile. Duplicate browser fingerprints get held for review before any referral credit is granted. Only real people move up.

7
00:00:56.978 --> 00:01:07.298
No glue code, no stitched-together stack. Pick a template, match your brand, and publish to your custom domain — or drop one embed snippet into your site in minutes.

8
00:01:08.448 --> 00:01:15.024
See which channels drive verified signups, with real conversion benchmarks and viral K-factor.

9
00:01:16.124 --> 00:01:22.124
Automate welcome and milestone emails, or invite your top supporters in launch-day waves.

10
00:01:23.224 --> 00:01:29.152
Connect your stack with signed webhooks, Slack and Discord alerts, and a server-side Signup API.

11
00:01:30.352 --> 00:01:36.328
Verified people. Compounding referrals. A launch list that actually shows up on day one.

12
00:01:37.878 --> 00:01:41.070
Waitlyze. Your launch starts before launch day.
